;; 90-docs/task-graphs/task-graph.datoms.edn — catalog of task-dependency
;; graphs ("workflows"), DataScript/Datomic-transactable tx-data (same shape
;; as 90-docs/adr/*.edn). It declares both the TOPOLOGY (workflow ids, task
;; ids, :task/requires edges) and the CURRENT STATE of each task
;; (:task/status, :task/status-at, :task/status-note).
;;
;; Edit entries IN PLACE to reflect the latest state — `git log -p` on this
;; file is the history. Owner decision 2026-07-25 (ADR-2607257000) retired the
;; former append-only 90-docs/task-graphs/task-graph-ledger.edn +
;; scripts/task-graph-ledger-append.cljs split (which existed because
;; DataScript has no as-of/history API); its two events were folded into the
;; :task/status fields below. Supersedes the ledger half of ADR-2607202800.
;;
;; :task/status — :pending (default when the key is absent) | :dispatched |
;; :started | :completed | :blocked | :skipped. scripts/task-graph-query.cljs
;; reads it directly to compute the ready set.
;;
;; Adding a new workflow: append a new :workflow/id block + its :task/id
;; entries to this vector.
;; :task/requires lists sibling :task/id strings within the same workflow.

